--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components and data

1. Craft Anything engine (craft-anything-cli)
   - Copyright: Craft Anything authors and contributors
   - License: Apache-2.0 (per the upstream repository)
   - Status here: NOT redistributed. No engine binary is included in this
     repository. The bridge starts a copy that you installed yourself, from the
     upstream release or from source.

2. catalog.json
   - A generated snapshot of the metadata the engine reports over MCP: tool
     names, English descriptions, toolsets, and read-only flags.
   - Source: `craft-anything-cli mcp --all-tools` output, fetched with
     `tools/generate-catalog.mjs`; regenerate it against your own engine build.
   - Those descriptions are upstream content under Apache-2.0. This repository
     redistributes them unmodified, as produced by the engine, with attribution
     to the upstream project.

3. catalog-zh.json
   - Chinese one-line explanations of those tools, written for this project.
   - License: Apache-2.0, same as the rest of this repository.

4. Craft Anything skill text
   - The bundled `skill.js` produces a SKILL.md written for this project. It is
     not a copy of the upstream `crates/setup/src/skill.md`; it states the same
     operating rules in our own words and adds the DeepSeek Harness specifics.
   - The upstream skill text, if present on your machine
     (`~/.claude/skills/craft-anything/SKILL.md`), belongs to the upstream
     project and is not included here.

5. Trademarks
   - "Craft Anything" and "ArtCraft" are used descriptively to name the software
     this bridge connects to. Brand assets from the upstream repository
     (docs/brand/) are not included; icon.svg in this repository is original.
   - "DeepSeek Harness" and "DSH" name the host application and belong to their
     respective owners.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What this repository does contain of its own

  bridge.js        stdio MCP client (JSON-RPC framing, process lifecycle)
  index.js         tool surface, approval gates, reverse mode, prompt section
  skill.js         host-neutral SKILL.md generator
  client.js        the sidebar panel (built by tools/build-client.mjs)
  locale/*.json    UI strings
  tools/*          catalog generation, client build, smoke tests, benchmark
  icon.svg         original artwork
